---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Privacy policy for fortpiercemoldspecialists.com.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>How we handle information on this site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>This website (fortpiercemoldspecialists.com) is a static informational site. We do not operate user accounts or collect personal data through forms on this site.</p>
      <h2>Phone Calls</h2>
      <p>If you call the number listed on this site, any information you provide is used only to respond to your inquiry and provide services.</p>
      <h2>Analytics &amp; Hosting</h2>
      <p>This site may be hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Standard server logs and any analytics configured by the site operator may record IP addresses, pages visited, and similar technical data. We do not sell personal information.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact us using the phone number on this website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
